    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING: This game contains at least 80% butt puns.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SYNOPSIS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our non-binary protagonist, adrift in their life, is looking at online influencers to fill the void. They wish they could be more like them...and then, POOF\u2014their wish is granted\u2014but with a <i>slight caveat...</i><br><br>Help them navigate a world filled with peril and problems as they search for purpose and self-love. Make impactful choices and guide our cheeked up hero to save the world... and themselves. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >laugh out loud dialog</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >extremely silly CGs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >three unique endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2,400 words / 15 minute playtime for all endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >copyright-free music that can be livestreamed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for streaming with friends and solo.</p>",
